096">they</span> <span begin="00:32.096" end="00:32.363">got</span> <span begin="00:32.363" end="00:32.960">nothin'</span> <span begin="00:32.960" end="00:33.195">on</span> <span begin="00:33.195" end="00:34.395">you,</span> <span begin="00:34.395" end="00:35.806">baby</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来吧 女孩们</span></p><p begin="00:36.554" end="00:37.554" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:36.554" end="00:37.554">Yeah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要停止</span></p><p begin="00:36.919" end="00:42.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:36.919" end="00:37.599">Nothin'</span> <span begin="00:37.599" end="00:37.834">on</span> <span begin="00:37.834" end="00:38.916">you,</span> <span begin="00:38.916" end="00:40.671">baby,</span> <span begin="00:41.183" end="00:42.884">yeah</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要停止</span></p><p begin="00:38.305" end="00:40.465" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:38.305" end="00:38.660">No-</span><span begin="00:38.660" end="00:38.977">no-</span><span begin="00:38.977" end="00:39.228">no-</span><span begin="00:39.228" end="00:39.526">nothin'</span> <span begin="00:39.526" end="00:39.777">on</span> <span begin="00:39.777" end="00:40.078">you,</span> <span begin="00:40.078" end="00:40.465">babe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她们都比不上你,宝贝</span></p><p begin="00:40.604" end="00:41.981" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:40.604" end="00:40.951">No-</span><span begin="00:40.951" end="00:41.236">nothin'</span> <span begin="00:41.236" end="00:41.503">on</span> <span begin="00:41.503" end="00:41.981">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可以去追求她们 但那只会浪费我的时间</span></p><p begin="00:42.141" end="00:44.181" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:42.141" end="00:42.461">I</span> <span begin="00:42.461" end="00:42.746">know</span> <span begin="00:42.746" end="00:42.994">you</span> <span begin="00:42.994" end="00:43.280">feel</span> <span begin="00:43.280" end="00:43.413">where</span> <span begin="00:43.413" end="00:43.529">I'm</span> <span begin="00:43.529" end="00:43.629">comin'</span> <span begin="00:43.629" end="00:44.181">from</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道你能看得出 我是什么样的人</span></p><p begin="00:44.377" end="00:46.497" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:44.377" end="00:44.806">Regardless</span> <span begin="00:44.806" end="00:44.942">of</span> <span begin="00:44.942" end="00:45.060">the</span> <span begin="00:45.060" end="00:45.342">things</span> <span begin="00:45.342" end="00:45.590">in</span> <span begin="00:45.590" end="00:45.892">my</span> <span begin="00:45.892" end="00:46.065">past</span> <span begin="00:46.065" end="00:46.190">that</span> <span begin="00:46.190" end="00:46.290">I've</span> <span begin="00:46.290" end="00:46.497">done</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管过去我做过什么荒唐事</span></p><p begin="00:46.698" end="00:48.700" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:46.698" end="00:47.061">Most</span> <span begin="00:47.061" end="00:47.210">of</span> <span begin="00:47.210" end="00:47.359">it</span> <span begin="00:47.359" end="00:47.477">really</span> <span begin="00:47.477" end="00:47.661">was</span> <span begin="00:47.661" end="00:47.834">for</span> <span begin="00:47.834" end="00:47.978">the</span> <span begin="00:47.978" end="00:48.095">hell</span> <span begin="00:48.095" end="00:48.226">of</span> <span begin="00:48.226" end="00:48.378">the</span> <span begin="00:48.378" end="00:48.700">fun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">她们都比不上你 亲爱的</span></p><p begin="00:49.013" end="00:51.120" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:49.013" end="00:49.213">On</span> <span begin="00:49.213" end="00:49.338">the</span> <span begin="00:49.338" end="00:49.989">carousel,</span> <span begin="00:49.989" end="00:50.104">so</span> <span begin="00:50.104" end="00:50.538">around</span> <span begin="00:50.538" end="00:50.757">I</span> <span begin="00:50.757" end="00:51.120">spun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像旋转木马般,我已晕头转向</span></p><p begin="00:51.424" end="00:53.440" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:51.424" end="00:51.605">With</span> <span begin="00:51.605" end="00:51.723">no</span> <span begin="00:51.723" end="00:52.389">direction,</span> <span begin="00:52.389" end="00:52.491">just</span> <span begin="00:52.491" end="00:52.840">tryna</span> <span begin="00:52.840" end="00:53.107">get</span> <span begin="00:53.107" end="00:53.440">some</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有人能与你媲美 亲爱的</span></p><p begin="00:53.667" end="00:55.747" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:53.667" end="00:54.024">Tryna</span> <span begin="00:54.024" end="00:54.307">chase</span> <span begin="00:54.307" end="00:54.590">skirts,</span> <span begin="00:54.590" end="00:54.856">livin'</span> <span begin="00:54.856" end="00:55.008">in</span> <span begin="00:55.008" end="00:55.123">the</span> <span begin="00:55.123" end="00:55.424">summer</span> <span begin="00:55.424" end="00:55.747">sun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有人能与你媲美</span></p><p begin="00:56.119" end="00:58.099" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:56.119" end="00:56.343">And</span> <span begin="00:56.343" end="00:56.468">so</span> <span begin="00:56.468" end="00:56.836">I</span> <span begin="00:56.836" end="00:56.986">lost</span> <span begin="00:56.986" end="00:57.119">more</span> <span begin="00:57.119" end="00:57.252">than</span> <span begin="00:57.252" end="00:57.368">I</span> <span begin="00:57.368" end="00:57.468">had</span> <span begin="00:57.468" end="00:57.735">ever</span> <span begin="00:57.735" end="00:58.099">won</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道你能看出来 我是什么样的人</span></p><p begin="00:58.427" end="01:00.275" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:58.427" end="00:58.608">And</span> <span begin="00:58.608" end="00:59.240">honestly,</span> <span begin="00:59.240" end="00:59.374">I</span> <span begin="00:59.374" end="00:59.726">ended</span> <span begin="00:59.726" end="00:59.908">up</span> <span begin="00:59.908" end="01:00.008">with</span> <span begin="01:00.008" end="01:00.275">none</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不管过去我做过什么荒唐的事情</span></p><p begin="01:00.734" end="01:02.998" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:00.734" end="01:00.926">There's</span> <span begin="01:00.926" end="01:01.041">so</span> <span begin="01:01.041" end="01:01.158">much</span> <span begin="01:01.158" end="01:01.958">nonsense,</span> <span begin="01:01.958" end="01:02.075">it's</span> <span begin="01:02.075" end="01:02.209">on</span> <span begin="01:02.209" end="01:02.323">my</span> <span begin="01:02.323" end="01:02.998">conscience</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大多数都是为了寻欢作乐而已</span></p><p begin="01:03.062" end="01:04.710" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:03.062" end="01:03.230">I'm</span> <span begin="01:03.230" end="01:03.403">thinkin'</span> <span begin="01:03.403" end="01:03.763">maybe</span> <span begin="01:03.763" end="01:03.921">I</span> <span begin="01:03.921" end="01:04.030">should</span> <span begin="01:04.030" end="01:04.131">get</span> <span begin="01:04.131" end="01:04.331">it</span> <span begin="01:04.331" end="01:04.710">out</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像旋转木马一样 我已经晕头转向</span></p><p begin="01:04.901" end="01:07.471" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:04.901" end="01:05.101">And</span> <span begin="01:05.101" end="01:05.210">I</span> <span begin="01:05.210" end="01:05.346">don't</span> <span begin="01:05.346" end="01:05.494">wanna</span> <span begin="01:05.494" end="01:05.594">sound</span> <span begin="01:05.594" end="01:06.577">redundant,</span> <span begin="01:06.577" end="01:06.677">but</span> <span begin="01:06.677" end="01:06.812">I</span> <span begin="01:06.812" end="01:06.912">was</span> <span begin="01:06.912" end="01:07.471">wonderin'</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有任何方向 只是试图追求什么</span></p><p begin="01:07.652" end="01:09.867" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:07.652" end="01:07.863">If</span> <span begin="01:07.863" end="01:07.996">there</span> <span begin="01:07.996" end="01:08.132">was</span> <span begin="01:08.132" end="01:08.447">somethin'</span> <span begin="01:08.447" end="01:08.580">that</span> <span begin="01:08.580" end="01:08.713">you</span> <span begin="01:08.713" end="01:08.999">wanna</span> <span begin="01:08.999" end="01:09.420">know</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:08.622" end="01:09.867"><span begin="01:08.622" end="01:09.015">(Somethin'</span> <span begin="01:09.015" end="01:09.147">that</span> <span begin="01:09.147" end="01:09.247">you</span> <span begin="01:09.247" end="01:09.532">wanna</span> <span begin="01:09.532" end="01:09.867">know)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要追逐夏日阳光里那些穿着短裙的女孩</span></p><p begin="01:09.633" end="01:12.198" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:09.633" end="01:09.873">But</span> <span begin="01:09.873" end="01:10.172">never</span> <span begin="01:10.172" end="01:10.457">mind</span> <span begin="01:10.457" end="01:10.724">that,</span> <span begin="01:10.724" end="01:10.841">we</span> <span begin="01:10.841" end="01:10.974">should</span> <span begin="01:10.974" end="01:11.190">let</span> <span begin="01:11.190" end="01:11.340">it</span> <span begin="01:11.340" end="01:11.658">go</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:11.183" end="01:12.198"><span begin="01:11.183" end="01:11.484">(We</span> <span begin="01:11.484" end="01:11.601">should</span> <span begin="01:11.601" end="01:11.719">let</span> <span begin="01:11.719" end="01:11.836">it</span> <span begin="01:11.836" end="01:12.198">go)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比起我曾经赢得胜利 我现在失去更多东西</span></p><p begin="01:12.004" end="01:14.645" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:12.004" end="01:12.199">'Cause</span> <span begin="01:12.199" end="01:12.332">we</span> <span begin="01:12.332" end="01:12.487">don't</span> <span begin="01:12.487" end="01:12.599">wanna</span> <span begin="01:12.599" end="01:12.732">be</span> <span begin="01:12.732" end="01:12.865">a</span> <span begin="01:12.865" end="01:13.199">TV</span> <span begin="01:13.199" end="01:14.164">episode</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:13.423" end="01:14.645"><span begin="01:13.423" end="01:13.873">(TV</span> <span begin="01:13.873" end="01:14.645">episode)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说实话 我最后一无所有</span></p><p begin="01:14.306" end="01:16.906" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:14.306" end="01:14.474">And</span> <span begin="01:14.474" end="01:14.607">all</span> <span begin="01:14.607" end="01:14.741">the</span> <span begin="01:14.741" end="01:15.042">bad</span> <span begin="01:15.042" end="01:15.325">thoughts,</span> <span begin="01:15.325" end="01:15.591">just</span> <span begin="01:15.591" end="01:15.757">let</span> <span begin="01:15.757" end="01:15.874">'em</span> <span begin="01:15.874" end="01:16.505">go</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:16.406" end="01:16.906"><span begin="01:16.406" end="01:16.906">(Go)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">做过太多愚蠢的事情</span></p><p begin="01:16.916" end="01:18.047" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:16.916" end="01:17.537">Go</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:17.547" end="01:18.047"><span begin="01:17.547" end="01:18.047">(Go)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在想亲爱的 我应该抛开一切</span></p><p begin="01:18.107" end="01:19.557" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:18.107" end="01:18.742">Go,</span> <span begin="01:18.742" end="01:19.557">hey</span><span ttm:role="x-translat